Code 1: The Consequence of Multiple app.Run Calls
app.Run(async (HttpContext context) => {
await context.Response.WriteAsync("Hello");
});
app.Run(async (HttpContext context) => {
await context.Response.WriteAsync("Hello again");
});
app.Run();
In this code, only the first app.Run middleware will be executed. It terminates the pipeline by writing
"Hello" to the response, and the subsequent app.Run (which would write "Hello again") never gets a
chance to run.
